{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25791","headline":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 忆东湖 · 李绅","name":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 忆东湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菱歌罢唱鷁舟回，雪鹭银鸥左右来。\n霞散浦边云锦截，月昇湖面镜波开。\n鱼惊翠羽金鳞跃，莲脱红衣紫菂摧。\n淮口值春偏怅望，数株临水是寒梅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}